===A2_S4_D3===
Silas: Oren, what did I tell you about fabricating details? #portrait:ElderAngry
Oren: Sorry, Silas… But you have to admit — the records we have from Noah’s time <i>do</i> point towards camaraderie and adventure. #portrait:Oren
Silas: You know that’s not what I mean. #portrait:ElderAngry
Narration: Oren’s gaze trails off to the treeline behind them.
Oren: Well, duty calls! I still have to tell the monsteratops calves a bedtime story. Promise I’ll cut down on the homoerotic tension for tomorrow’s bit! #portrait:Oren
Narration: And with that, Oren is gone like the wind.
Narration: Silas shakes his head sternly, but a small smile lingers on his lips.
Silas: To think you were a nervous lad just a couple of years ago… #portrait:ElderThinking
->DONE